  ('fp-g00019', 'forest-production', 'forest-biometry-mensuration-inventory', 'Hard', 'practice',
   'You are conducting a forest inventory using systematic sampling with fixed-radius plots of 1000 square meters each. If the average basal area per plot is 5 square meters and you have surveyed 50 plots, what is the estimated total basal area for the 50-hectare area?',
