  ('fp-g00020', 'forest-production', 'forest-biometry-mensuration-inventory', 'Hard', 'practice',
   'A forester is conducting an inventory in a dipterocarp forest in the Philippines. They measure the DBH of 10 trees as follows: 30 cm, 45 cm, 50 cm, 40 cm, 60 cm, 55 cm, 65 cm, 50 cm, 45 cm, and 35 cm. What is the quadratic mean diameter (QMD) of these trees?',
